WEBVTT

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.040
Well, thanks for calling. And, uh, give my best to Marty. Okay.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:12.520
Hey, I was just down there leaning on Mitch, who's got two teams working OT to finish the hotel order, by the way.

00:00:13.060 --> 00:00:17.160
And, uh, I got a call on my cell phone from Steve Wayne over at Style Barn.

00:00:17.720 --> 00:00:18.680
Russo Furniture's going under.

00:00:18.950 --> 00:00:20.230
Yeah, that's right. How did you hear?

00:00:20.510 --> 00:00:23.790
That was Baxter Mills. Russo was one of their biggest customers.

00:00:24.070 --> 00:00:26.310
Those were the guys that kept stealing our space in the showrooms, right?

00:00:27.860 --> 00:00:28.840
So what happened to them?

00:00:30.670 --> 00:00:33.980
Man, that company, that company looked a lot like us.

00:00:36.910 --> 00:00:37.590
Should we be worried?

00:00:37.770 --> 00:00:45.340
I was thinking the same thing on the other hand.

00:00:46.370 --> 00:00:47.810
All their accounts are up for grabs.

00:00:48.070 --> 00:00:49.350
You know who their number one client is?

00:00:50.170 --> 00:00:50.830
Jason Kimble.

00:00:51.140 --> 00:00:52.540
Kimble Interiors, Jason Kimble?

00:00:52.660 --> 00:00:53.840
We need to get in a room with that guy.

00:00:55.310 --> 00:00:55.630
Hidday.

00:00:56.140 --> 00:00:58.740
