00:01:25.350 --> 00:01:27.180
Go be with your wife, okay?

00:01:27.340 --> 00:01:28.420
I will type up the offer.

00:01:28.600 --> 00:01:29.300
You come in the morning.

00:01:29.480 --> 00:01:29.960
