Now that I've seen the error of my ways,

00:40:12.560 --> 00:40:15.230
now that the wasted year is ending.

00:40:17.980 --> 00:40:18.440
What it was?

00:40:23.350 --> 00:40:26.790
Listen, this has nothing to do with you.

00:40:28.330 --> 00:40:28.910
Not really.

00:40:30.510 --> 00:40:33.140
It's more like, what's wrong with my life

00:40:33.140 --> 00:40:35.720
if the most useful thing I can think to do

00:40:36.510 --> 00:40:38.870
is to marry someone to help them get their green card?

00:40:42.250 --> 00:40:45.820
Will, I'm sorry.

00:40:47.850 --> 00:40:51.540
Don't be. I'd do it all again.

00:40:52.710 --> 00:40:53.850
Because the reason I did it...

00:40:54.130 --> 00:40:58.420
I know. You're the most unbelievable friend.

00:41:00.640 --> 00:41:08.210
And now you're leaving. Everybody's leaving all of a sudden.

00:41:10.940 --> 00:41:14.540
It's just time.

00:41:14.720 --> 00:41:20.960
I understand. I actually do.

00:41:23.450 --> 00:41:28.660
What does that mean? Are you thinking of making a move too?

00:41:32.200 --> 00:41:32.660
I don't know.

00:41:37.010 --> 00:41:42.240
If you ever make a move back east, I hope it's near me.

00:41:47.880 --> 00:41:48.260
Me too.

00:42:00.920 --> 00:42:01.160
Thank you.
